    "body": "@mfreed7 and I probably made this mistake while working on #5465. Finding the exact discussion is hard given that GitHub hides everything by default.\n\nI think we can do what WebKit implements here which is assert that template contents is not a `ShadowRoot` node. Because whenever it is a `ShadowRoot` node we don't actually create a `template` element (it's only on the HTML parser stack) so there's nothing to run script against.",
